{"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Essentials-KeyboardView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This article describes the native-looking "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView"},{"type":"text","text":" and how to use it."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"KeyboardKit has a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView"},{"type":"text","text":" that mimics the native iOS keyboard. It supports "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType"},{"type":"text","text":"s like "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/alphabetic","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/numeric","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/symbolic","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/emojis","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/numberPad","isActive":true},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/KeyboardType\/clipboard","isActive":true},{"text":", as well as any ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardLayout","isActive":true},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/Placement","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Keyboard\/TextInputType","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row","columns":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"KeyboardView-English-Callout","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"KeyboardView-Swedish-Theme"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"size":1}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" will set up most things, like gestures, styles, callouts, settings, etc. based on the current services and state. It will automatically observe all contexts and settings, and resize the keyboard extension accordingly.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"👑 KeyboardKit Pro can unlocks support for all supported locales and inject an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/EmojiKeyboard","type":"reference"},{"text":" view into the keyboard view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Customization","text":"Customization","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be customized in many ways, for instance by mutating the various contexts and settings, by injecting custom layouts and views, and by applying various view modifiers to modify behavior and styling."}]},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The easiest way to customize the keyboard behavior is to inherit "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/StandardKeyboardActionHandler","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" and customize the behavior of any gesture on any action."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Actions-Article"},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Action Behavior"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The easiest way to customize the secondary callout actions is to apply a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardCalloutActions(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" modifier to the view and customize the standard actions that are provided as view builder parameters.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Callouts-Article","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Callouts"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The easiest way to customize the keyboard layout is to inject a custom layout in the initializer. You can use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardLayout\/standard(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to get a standard layout for the current context, then modify it as needed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Layout-Article","isActive":true},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Layout"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can customize the styling of the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and its nested views by applying any of the many style-based view modifiers, like ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardViewStyle(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardButtonStyle(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Styling-Article","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Styling"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can customize the entire keyboard style by applying a single "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardTheme","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardTheme(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" view modifier."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"See the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/Themes-Article","isActive":true},{"text":" article for more information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Themes"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can customize any view or button content in the keyboard, by injecting custom view builders into the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView"},{"type":"text","text":" initializer:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["KeyboardView(","    layout: ...,                        \/\/ You can inject a custom layout if you want to","    services: controller.services,      \/\/ You can inject a controller's or custom services","    buttonContent: { $0.view },         \/\/ You can customize the content view of any button","    buttonView: { $0.view },            \/\/ You can customize the entire view of any button","    collapsedView: { $0.view },         \/\/ You can customize the collapsed keyboard view","    emojiKeyboard: { $0.view },         \/\/ You can customize the emoji keyboard, if any","    toolbar: { params in params.view }  \/\/ You can customize the toolbar above the keyboard",")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can return "},{"code":"$0.view","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"params in params.view","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") to use the original views, or return any custom view based on the params."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also completely replace the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView"},{"text":" with another view at any time. Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/SwiftUICore\/View\/keyboardReplacementOverlay(isPresented:content:)"},{"text":" extension to replace the keyboard with a custom view of the same size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"title":"Views"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Locales","text":"Locales"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/src.KeyboardKit\/documentation\/KeyboardKit\/KeyboardView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","tex